# SABOTAGE: P18 — THE TENANT CHROME TREATS EVERY SESSION AS AN OPERATOR
# `Samen.Web.Operator.Authz.seat_role/2` is the ONE thing that tells a TENANT surface whether the
# signed-in principal also holds operator authority, and its whole value is the FAIL-CLOSED
# answer: no seam, a denying seam, or a role-shaped lie all mean "not an operator", so the shared
# sidebar offers the operator console to operators and withholds it from plain tenants. This patch
# makes a NIL answer default to `:operator_admin` — the shape of a "make the console easy to find
# in dev" change — so every tenant session gets the `/operator/accounts` entry in its switcher,
# and the click dead-ends at the always-on operator gate. That is exactly the dead-link class the
# nav verifier exists to retire, and it is invisible from the operator plane.
#
# Deliberately NOT touched: the resolving branch's real answer (a genuine `:operator_support`
# stays support), and the rescue leg (a RAISING seam still yields no seat). So the sabotage
# discriminates: the four "denied" assertions flip, the raising-seam assertion stays green.
#
# APP: samen_web
# TEST_FILES: test/samen/web/operator_seat_test.exs
# MUST_FAIL: RED: no seam anywhere means no seat (a host that wires nothing exposes nothing)
# MUST_FAIL: RED: a seam that DENIES means no seat
# MUST_FAIL: RED: a role-shaped LIE (an atom outside roles/0) means no seat
# MUST_FAIL: RED: a plain tenant session gets a NIL seat assigned (never a fabricated one)
--- a/samen_web/lib/samen/web/operator/authz.ex
+++ b/samen_web/lib/samen/web/operator/authz.ex
@@ -139,10 +139,10 @@
   def seat_role(%Mount{} = mount, session) when is_map(session) do
     case authority_mfa(mount) || app_env_authority(mount) do
       {mod, fun, args} when is_atom(mod) and is_atom(fun) and is_list(args) ->
-        validate_role(apply(mod, fun, args ++ [principal_id(mount, session)]))
+        validate_role(apply(mod, fun, args ++ [principal_id(mount, session)])) || :operator_admin
 
       _ ->
-        nil
+        :operator_admin
     end
   rescue
     _ -> nil
